  "ruleText": "He-W 606.73 Child Care Costs for All Categories. If the individual refuses or fails to verify child care costs, the unverified amount shall not be:\n\n(a) An allowable employment expense; or\n\n(b) Subtracted from household income when determining financial eligibility.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #5171, eff 6-26-91; ss by #6531, INTERIM, eff 6-27-97, EXPIRES: 10-25-97; ss by #6614, eff 10-24-97; ss by #8452, eff 10-22-05; ss by #10471, eff 11-26-13; ss by #10471, eff 11-26-13; ss by #13875, eff 2-21-24",
